# Per-triplet artefacts inside experiments/phase2b_triplets/<sid>__<nid>/:
# the agent-generated code, executed STEP, log files.  We DO commit
# the per-triplet triplet.json (small) and the SUMMARY / manifest
# files at the root of phase2b_triplets/.
